---
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import PostHog from '../components/posthog.astro';
import '../styles/design-system.css';
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><meta name="description" content="Explore Aether scene library, podcast studio and relaxation applications."/><title>Other Aether tools | Aether</title><link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg"/><PostHog /></head><body><SiteHeader/><main id="main"><p class="eyebrow">Other Aether tools</p><h1>Explore the wider Aether platform.</h1><p class="lead">These existing applications remain accessible while Environmental Canvas is the primary commercial focus.</p><div class="cards"><article class="card"><h3>Scene Library</h3><p>Browse and customise browser-based environmental scenes.</p><a href="/studio/">Open scene library →</a></article><article class="card"><h3>Podcast & Stream</h3><p>Prepare branded show settings and export visuals for OBS.</p><a href="/studio/podcast/">Open podcast studio →</a></article><article class="card"><h3>Relaxation Studio</h3><p>Create timed or untimed experiences with optional guidance.</p><a href="/studio/guided-relaxation/">Open relaxation sessions →</a></article></div><p>These tools are maintained separately from the Environmental Canvas pilot and are not presented as enterprise signage features.</p></main><SiteFooter/></body></html><style>
:global(html){background:#070b12;color:#f4f7ff;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif} :global(body){margin:0;background:radial-gradient(circle at 85% 10%,#14223c 0%,transparent 40%),#070b12;color:#f4f7ff} :global(a){color:inherit} main{max-width:1180px;margin:auto;padding:48px 20px 100px} .eyebrow{color:#7dd3fc;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:12px;font-weight:700}h1{font-size:clamp(42px,6vw,78px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.055em;max-width:900px;margin:18px 0}h2{font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,44px);letter-spacing:-.04em}p{line-height:1.7;color:#b8c7dc;max-width:740px}.lead{font-size:clamp(17px,2vw,22px)}.actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:32px 0 56px}.button{display:inline-block;border:1px solid #40536d;padding:14px 20px;border-radius:999px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}.primary{background:#d9f5ed;color:#092019;border-color:#d9f5ed}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px;margin:24px 0 60px}.card{padding:26px;background:#101a2a;border:1px solid #263850;border-radius:16px}.card h3{font-size:22px;margin:10px 0}.card p{font-size:15px}.card a{color:#7dd3fc}.section{border-top:1px solid #243248;padding-top:32px;margin-top:42px}@media(max-width:760px){.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}main{padding-top:25px}}
</style>